# cli/

Command-line interface for Udex. Provides the entry point, command dispatch, CLI argument parsing, and configuration management for the Udex server. Integrates Tokio runtime, TLS provider initialization, and OAuth2 token operations through Clap command definitions and configuration structures.

## Dirs

- `src/` -- CLI and configuration layer with main entry point, command definitions, and config structures
- `tests/` -- Integration tests for CLI operations, server lifecycle, and OAuth2 token handling

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Package definition and workspace dependencies
- `README.md` -- CLI documentation including command reference and usage examples
